# Quran synchronization is part of the public product dataset:
# - backend/src/islamtrove/data/alignments/*.json: base audio timelines
# - backend/review-data/*.json: verified Ayahs, corrections, and review history
# Both directories MUST remain eligible for Git. Deployed writes still need
# persistence, backups, and a deliberate sync/PR to enter Git history.

# Generated alignment experiments and reports, not published canonical timelines.
backend/scripts/offline-audio-alignment/candidates/
backend/scripts/offline-audio-alignment/reports/

